    "Optional local wind sensor, for example sensor.netatmo_tuuli_ms using m/s. Valid readings are averaged over the last 30 minutes. ThermalPilot learns a separate wind effect only after enough varied observations; no fixed wind penalty is assumed. Missing, invalid or unchanged-for-two-hours readings are ignored, and normal temperature-based planning and heating continue. Fresh wind correction gradually returns to typical conditions in forecasts further ahead. A stable calm reading may also be ignored conservatively. Units are detected automatically.": "Opcionális szél, automatikus egység, 30 perc átlag. Változó adatokból tanul. Hiányzó, hibás vagy 2 órát állandó figyelmen kívül; fűtés folytatódik. Távoli előrejelzés tipikus szélhez tér.",
    "Optional price forecast unavailable; planning uses confirmed prices and the normal heat reserve.": "Előrejelzés hiányzik; megerősített ár és normál tartalék.",
    "Optional sensor with forecast timestamp/value entries, such as Nordpool Predict FI. Only relative expensive/cheap patterns after confirmed prices are used, so no forecast price unit or additional costs are required. The Source price unit setting applies only to the confirmed total-price sensor. An expensive upcoming period can increase the heat reserve at the end of the known-price plan. Forecast prices are not compared directly with your total prices, used as confirmed prices or used to execute future heating commands. Missing forecasts keep normal planning. Confirmed prices always determine the executable schedule.": "Opcionális relatív trend megerősített árak után. Egység és pótdíj nem kell. Növelhet tartalékot, soha nem megerősített ár vagy jövőbeni parancs. Hiány: normál terv.",
